# How the engine draws a card of an own GLB with an alpha mask: vertex normals, sides, the layer's `rotation`
# (reports/engine/2026-11-13-grass/README.md, section 4). The set is built by scripts/content/own_glb_probe.py;
# run with OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<that set>. The panels hang 2.7 m over the hero's spot of the `ledge` view of
# landscape-rock-material.bench and face the first camera.
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
set time 12 0
goto pos 35110 3829 429
clear 3000
streaming wait
cam at 35110 4100 99 35110 4100 429
wait 6000
shot front
wait 200
cam at 35110 4100 759 35110 4100 429
wait 4000
shot back
wait 200
# a low sun from the side: the normals against a light that is not overhead
set time 17 30
cam at 35110 4100 99 35110 4100 429
wait 6000
shot front-eve
wait 200
